# passes/seaopt/build.list -- what make adds to the pass's own passes/seaopt/*.bas (DESIGN.md 2.6.3).
#   lib <module>...   shared modules of passes/lib/ (io diag tables lirrw limb f64emu fltlit layout ralloc;
#                     lirrw, a main-program part, never together with limb or f64emu)
#   data <block>...   generated DATA blocks (errors errno exits consts entries records)
# The build concatenates the parts in the canonical order of DESIGN.md 2.6.3 whatever the
# order written here; a name outside the two sets is a build error.
lib io diag tables lirrw
data errors exits consts entries records
